SUMMARY:Tech Workers Coalition Public Gathering
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20261209T180000Z
DTEND:20261209T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Do you work in a tech-adjacent role or field or are otherwise i
 nterested in tech from a worker's perspective? Join us at 19:00 on 9 Decem
 ber at Joe's Garage for an informal gathering. If you have any topics you
  want to discuss or share about your workplace\, the industry in general\,
  or anything else\, you are very welcome to! About Tech Workers Coalition
  Tech Workers Coalition Netherlands (techwerkers dot nl) is a community of
  tech workers doing workplace organizing and outreach in order to take bac
 k worker power in The Netherlands. From engineers and delivery drivers to
  content moderators\, customer service agents\, warehouse workers\, teache
 rs\, and video game artists—anyone in a tech-adjacent role or workplace
  or who has to use tech in their job can join.
LOCATION:Joe's Garage Pretoriusstraat 43  Amsterdam Pays-Bas
URL:https://radar.squat.net/en/event/amsterdam/joes-garage/2026-12-09/tech-
 workers-coalition-public-gathering
END:VEVENT
